        },
        {
          "id": "p4-8",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Then over in Germany at the Max Planck Institute, there’s another biologist called Catarina Miranda who’s done some experiments with blackbirds living in urban and rural areas. And she’s been looking not at their anatomy but at their behaviour."
